# Web app rules

## Data fetching

- Client components use `useTRPC()` from `@/lib/trpc` with
  `trpc.<router>.<proc>.queryOptions` / `mutationOptions` (TanStack Query).
  After mutations, invalidate via `queryKey`.
- Toasts via `sonner`; sentence-case messages ("Domain created").
- Better-auth client from `@/lib/auth-client`; POSTs to `/api/auth/*` from
  non-browser contexts must include an `Origin` header (CSRF).

## Components & styling

- shadcn/ui primitives in `@/components/ui`; Tailwind v4 classes; lucide icons.
- Every list/query surface ships with three states from day one: loading
  skeleton, error-with-retry, empty state (see `components/query-state.tsx`
  and `components/services/empty-state.tsx`).
- Dialogs: content grids need `min-w-0` tracks (`dialog.tsx` already sets
  `grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)]`) or wide content overflows the panel.
- SSR/CSR consistency: gate client-only rendering behind a mounted flag —
  mismatches hydrate the whole tree again (see `user-menu.tsx`).
- Log rendering goes through `components/services/log-viewer.tsx` (level
  badges + colors); monitoring through `monitoring-charts.tsx` — extend them
  instead of forking viewers.

## Routing

- Dashboard routes live in `src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/…`; services are
  `projects/[projectId]/services/<type>/<id>` with `<type>` in
  application | compose | postgres | mysql | mariadb | mongo | redis.
- `useSearchParams` requires a `<Suspense>` boundary in the page.
